  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for workforce development meeting industry demands in Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expansion of Access to TVET in Cambodia, Capacity Strengthening of Selected TVET Institutions Aligned with Domestic and Overseas Labor Market Requirements, Establishment of an Effective Labor Supply Demand Linkage System</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project objectives are to nurture a skilled Cambodian workforce to meet the demans of both the Cambodian and Korean labor markets through strengthened TVET capacity&#xc0b0;&#xc5c5; &#xc804;&#xbc18;&#xc5d0;&#xc11c; &#xd65c;&#xc6a9;&#xb3c4;&#xac00; &#xb192;&#xc740; &#xae30;&#xacc4;(&#xc6a9;&#xc811;), &#xac74;&#xc124;(&#xac74;&#xcd95;) &#xc804;&#xacf5;&#xc758; &#xae30;&#xc220;&#xad50;&#xc721; &#xc218;&#xc900;&#xc744; &#xce84;&#xbcf4;&#xb514;&#xc544; &#xad6d;&#xb0b4; &#xbc0f; &#xd55c;&#xad6d; &#xb4f1; &#xc678;&#xad6d; &#xc0b0;&#xc5c5;&#xc5d0;&#xc11c; &#xc694;&#xad6c;&#xd558;&#xb294; &#xc218;&#xc900;&#xc73c;&#xb85c; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;</narrative>
  </description>
